Cell["\<\
The cylinder of radius 0 is the axis. Its Riemannian measure is 0: a path in \
a grid is all boundary.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"d59389b5-d7c8-4f03-ae64-5368995a9d20"],

